Hi!

I now have Tiki admin access and checked the site configuration. I confirm
that there are local hacks (presumably just one) which is messing up
several things.

For example, tabs (which permit to have shorter/cleaner page) are not
working, the toolbar is missing (see attached screenshot), and there are
likely other issues related to JavaScript. Registered users had the
permission to modify the site templates. I suspect that someone tried to
improve something and broke something without noticing. I turned this
feature off for Registered users. Users only need to focus on content, and
it's a smaller team which should make changes to the site templates. Just
contact me if you want access.

I will soon have server access so I will be able to correct this, by
restoring the default templates.

In  the mean time, please everyone who has any
questions/bugs/issues/frustrations with Tiki, please add them here:
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/Tiki+Administration

And I'll address them one by one.

Best regards,

M ;-)


